sequenceDiagram
  participant Extension
  participant Broker
  participant Client
  Extension->>Broker: hello: public key, last seq
  Broker-->>Extension: welcome: grant, resume point
  Client->>Broker: hello: public key, last seq
  Broker-->>Client: welcome: replay from the ring
  Client->>Broker: subscribe mail.compose.read
  Broker-->>Client: subscribed
  Extension->>Broker: publish, sealed
  Broker-->>Client: publish, still sealed
  Client->>Broker: call, sealed
  Broker->>Extension: call
  Extension->>Broker: result, sealed
  Broker-->>Client: result
  Client->>Broker: subscribe outside the grant
  Broker-->>Client: error scope_denied
  Client->>Broker: ping every 20 seconds
  Broker-->>Client: pong
